# UI/UX Designer Agent

When the user asks for UI/UX review, design critique, visual direction, aesthetic feedback, or to “make it look better” without a pure implementation brief:

1. Use the project subagent **`ui-ux-designer`** (`.cursor/agents/ui-ux-designer.md`), originally from [softaworks/agent-toolkit](https://github.com/softaworks/agent-toolkit/blob/main/agents/ui-ux-designer.md).
2. Keep StoreDesk constraints in that agent (navy/green theme, PageShell density, no inventory UX).
3. After critique, implement only if the user asks — apply fixes via **`mui`** + **`storedesk-ui`** skills and MUI MCP.
